@startuml
title Payment and partial payment allocation
actor Debtor
participant PaymentUseCase
participant Authorization
database Transaction
participant Journal
Debtor -> PaymentUseCase: record amount/date
PaymentUseCase -> Authorization: current group/pair access?
PaymentUseCase -> Transaction: begin; re-read outstanding debt
alt amount exceeds current debt
 Transaction --> PaymentUseCase: reject; no writes
else amount within debt
 Transaction -> Journal: append payment + offset posting atomically
 Journal --> Transaction: committed once
end
PaymentUseCase --> Debtor: result and updated balance
@enduml
